\": \"Burnt Layer Stack\",\n      \"flavour\": \"Quilted sheeting stacked four deep, cream over rust over blue, with a hole burnt clean through the top face. Tough enough to bundle and cheap enough that nobody hurries.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"light\", \"low\", \"cheap\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cracked_solar_array\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Cracked Solar Array\",\n      \"flavour\": \"Two gridded blue fragments split off the same panel, edges gone pale where the glass gave. Carry it like glass, off the bottom shelf where the panels are cheap.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"fragile\", \"low\", \"cheap\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"bent_truss_section\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Rusty Rod Tangle\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A dozen straight rusty bars crossed every which way into a flat mat, speckled where the coating went. Solid enough to drag, low enough down the band to be worth little.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"solid\", \"low\", \"cheap\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"spent_kick_motor_casing\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Spent Kick Motor Bell\",\n      \"flavour\": \"An hourglass nozzle, flared at both ends and dark at the throat, burnt out long before it drifted down here. A dense little lump of metal off the cheap end of the band.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"solid\", \"low\", \"cheap\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"collapsed_dish_frame\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Collapsed Dish Frame\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A shallow grey dish still sat on its stand, feed knob hanging over the middle and the rim stove in on one side. Awkward on the tether and worth little this far down.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"oversized\", \"low\", \"solid\", \"cheap\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"shredded_antenna_mesh\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Snapped Antenna Boom\",\n      \"flavour\": \"One long shaft carrying ten short elements across it, half of them kinked or snapped off at the root. The rest go the same way if you swing it about.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"fragile\", \"low\", \"cheap\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cracked_battery_pallet\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Framed Battery Pallet\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A dark slab of cells boxed inside a thick yellow frame that has done its job, one small indicator eye at the corner. Solid, dull, and cheap off the low shelf.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"solid\", \"low\", \"cheap\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"seized_reaction_wheel_housing\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Seized Reaction Wheel\",\n      \"flavour\": \"Eight spokes out to a flat rim, one notch knocked from the edge, and a hub that has not turned in years. Dense for its size and still only bottom-of-the-band money.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"solid\", \"low\", \"cheap\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"burst_pressurant_sphere\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Pitted Rock Cluster\",\n      \"flavour\": \"Three or four black chunks pressed together, faces pitted and edges chipped pale. No seam, no plating, nothing anybody built, and priced accordingly this low.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"solid\", \"low\", \"cheap\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"delaminated_radiator_fin\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Bolted Radiator Plate\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A stepped grey plate with six bolt holes at the corners and two scratches scored across the face. Thin as a wafer, and it will fold or split if you let it swing on the line.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"fragile\", \"low\", \"cheap\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"torn_solar_wing_spar\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Paired Solar Wings\",\n      \"flavour\": \"Two tall gridded wings side by side, dark blue cells behind pale dividers, one sitting a touch out of line with the other. Framed and stiff enough to take the tether as it is.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"solid\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cracked_optics_barrel\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Optics Barrel\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A ringed barrel on its side, dark front element still holding a clean cyan glint, a spare ring section behind it. One knock on the way in and the glass is gone.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"fragile\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fractured_docking_collar\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Fractured Docking Collar\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A heavy ring around the hollow a hatch used to fill, a bite broken out of one side and chips still drifting alongside it. Solid enough to haul in the state it is in.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"solid\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"dead_thruster_quad\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Dead Thruster Housing\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A corrugated drum bolted to a tan housing, one brown feed line looping over the top and back down. Plumbing off something that stopped firing a long time ago.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"solid\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"buckled_pressure_bulkhead\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Buckled Bulkhead Sheet\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A ragged grey plate with a crease driven right through it and chips still coming off the torn edge. It takes both arms, the tether, and most of your patience.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"heavy\", \"oversized\", \"solid\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ruptured_helium_tank\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Strapped Soft Goods Roll\",\n      \"flavour\": \"Quilted blue matting rolled tight and banded around the middle with tan webbing, both ends still square. Bulky in the arms, and no give at all in the straps.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"medium\", \"solid\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"shattered_star_tracker\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Shattered Star Tracker\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A bevelled frame holding pale blue glass, cracks running out from a black star-shaped hole punched dead centre. What is left is holding on out of habit.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"fragile\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"warped_gyro_deck\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Avionics Control Cabinet\",\n      \"flavour\": \"An upright grey cabinet with a dead blue screen, rows of indicator strips, two cables trailing from the bottom and a yellow rod jutting off one corner. Square and solid.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"solid\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cracked_ablative_nose_cone\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Cracked Nose Cone Shell\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A tapering grey shell with a rib down its spine and a jagged broken edge where the rest of it went. Already half gone; do not give it a reason to finish the job.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"fragile\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"split_avionics_rack\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Avionics Card\",\n      \"flavour\": \"One green board, two fat black chips, a row of gold fingers along the bottom edge. It snaps like a biscuit if the tether jerks, so get it aboard flat.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"fragile\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"torn_reactor_shield_plate\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Broken Board Fragment\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A jagged green shard with two yellow stripes and a rust-brown wire still curling off the underside, a splinter drifting beside it. Scrap, but scrap off the top shelf where it pays.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"high\", \"valuable\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\", \"5b\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cracked_deep_space_dish\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Cracked Deep Space Dish\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A grey dish on a blocky base, feed arm still strutted across its face, rim stove in and buckled. Thin metal and high money, and it crumples if you rush the haul.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"fragile\", \"high\", \"valuable\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\", \"5b\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fused_ion_grid_assembly\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Empty Shard Frame\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A square navy frame with nothing left inside but pale cyan shards leaning in from the corners. Every one of them is one knock from the floor of the hold.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"fragile\", \"high\", \"valuable\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\", \"5b\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"severed_boom_mast\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Severed Cable Run\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A braided strand run out on the diagonal and frayed into a bristly knot where it was cut through. Heavy, unruly, and dear enough up here to be worth the wrestle.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"heavy\", \"high\", \"oversized\", \"valuable\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\", \"5b\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"scorched_fuel_cell_stack\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Tray Of Power Cells\",\n      \"flavour\": \"An open grey case divided into compartments of blocky cells, charge bars still showing yellow and red. Clean, whole, and worth real money at this height.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"high\", \"valuable\", \"solid\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\", \"5b\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"shattered_cryo_dewar\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Stencilled Water Tank\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A bright cyan tank on its side, stub fittings at each end and H2O stencilled across the middle panel. The wall is thin enough to split on the rim if you land it hard.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"fragile\", \"high\", \"valuable\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\", \"5b\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"impact_pitted_engine_bell\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Pitted Engine Bell\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A ringed cone standing on a rust-crusted rim with the throat gone black with soot. Solid metal all the way through, and it charges you for every metre of the climb down.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"heavy\", \"high\", \"solid\", \"medium\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\", \"5b\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cracked_command_module_hatch\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Six Sided Ring\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A plain six-sided ring with a hole through the middle and a shine on one flat. Thin-walled, so it splits across the corners if it takes a knock on the way in.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"fragile\", \"high\", \"valuable\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\", \"5b\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"armstrongs_module\",\n      \"display_name\": \"Armstrong's Module\",\n      \"flavour\": \"A dented grey canister banded in yellow, hardware old enough to have outlived the cascade, hanging at the very top of the envelope. It takes the whole tank and every metre of tether.\",\n      \"reads_as\": [\"heavy\", \"high\", \"valuable\", \"small\"],\n      \"grounded_in\": [\"2.6a\", \"5d\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"Size-class values in reads_as now use only the table's spellings (small, medium, oversized); silhouette words were dropped.\"\n  ]\n}","ttft_ms":90058,"ttft_stream_ms":2795,"time_to_request_ms":211,"type":"result","duration_ms":126827,"uuid":"0f080a17-d931-4960-bfe2-e8b430771eba"}
